ere","synopsis":"Adonis turns on Sherry, only for Belle to swoop in, determined to settle their differences once and for all.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11025874/screencap/682782a60f5be.jpg"},{"title":"Hymn: Erewhon","synopsis":"Belle finds new strength within herself. Sherry's choice shakes Gaff to the core.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11025875/screencap/6830979006248.jpg"},{"title":"Reason: Moonwork","synopsis":"Belle learns her past and the world's, but can it give her the answers she's been seeking?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11025876/screencap/6839dea72c6f2.jpg"},{"title":"Nomad: Now Here","synopsis":"Belle says her goodbyes and prepares to finally set out on her journey.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11025877/screencap/684314ebb6116.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
